      "player": "Llama4 Spike",
      "decision_index": 22,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Fetching Watery Grave instead of a basic Island when there's no need for the dual land. The player already has a Swamp in hand for black mana and Cephalid Coliseum for blue. A basic Island enters untapped for free, while Watery Grave either costs 2 life or enters tapped. With only 13 life and no spells in hand requiring both colors immediately, there's no upside to the dual land.",
      "action_taken": "Fetched Watery Grave from library with Polluted Delta",
