    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Casting Gran-Gran before Psychic Frog is slightly risky sequencing. If opponent has interaction (they have Drown in the Loch in graveyard but could have drawn one), the less impactful creature resolves while the better one might get countered. Psychic Frog is the superior standalone threat with combat damage draw, pump ability, and flying from exiling graveyard cards (30 cards available).",
